    dcterms:description "Responsible AI has, at its core, human-centric principles defining benefits and risks of recent generative AI applications. The purpose of this paper is to look at current and future Responsible AI policies and regulations with a focus on text-based Generative Artificial Intelligence (Gen AI) systems. Information retrieval and knowledge management research and applications provide a sound basis for the development of Gen AI. The goal is to encourage early engagement in the development of the next generation of Responsible AI policies and regulations in parallel with the emergence of the next g" ;
